<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE IN 2ND TEST, WIN SERIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE IN 2ND TEST, WIN SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>FAISALABAD, Pakistan 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Zimbabwe by 10 wickets on the third day of the second and final test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 133 and 200, Pakistan 267 and 69-0.</p>
<p>Pakistan win series 1-0.</p>
</text>
